                                      rdfs:label "Identifier"@en ;
                                      <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Examples include International Standard Book Number (ISBN), Digital Object Identifier (DOI), and Uniform Resource Name (URN)." .


###  http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#asWKT
<http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#asWKT> rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
